      },
      "rev_n_3_821f9a_1": {
        "revision_id": "rev_n_3_821f9a_1",
        "node_id": "n_3_821f9a",
        "thought_text": "Binary Search with Correct Mid Calculation\n\nTo avoid overflow errors, use integer arithmetic for the mid calculation and ensure the loop condition is correct. Calculate `mid` as `(left + right + 1) // 2` to guarantee convergence. Adjust the loop condition to `left <= right`.",
